OL,5,G0532 Dear Daughter
OL,6,     FIn 2010, 19-year-old Ann was
OL,7,     Fkilled by her boyfriend. Her
OL,8,     Fmother, Kate, tells Namulanta
OL,9,     Fabout how she chose restorative
OL,10,     Fjustice over court to confront the
OL,11,     Fimpact of her death.
